        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Decide which optional fifth doc deserves promotion into the canonical pack. Defend the cut.\n2. Rewrite the installer as Python with a `--dry-run` flag. Compare ergonomics against bash.\n3. Add a `bin/uninstall.sh` that safely removes the pack and refuses if state files have non-trivial history. What counts as non-trivial?\n4. Add a `lint_pack.py` that fails when the pack drifts from `VERSION`. Wire it into CI for the pack's own repo.\n5. Author the migration runbook from a hand-rolled workbench to this pack. What is the order of operations that minimizes downtime?"
      ]
